@startuml Kode-Komponentdiagram
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
top to bottom direction
skinparam nodesep 80
skinparam ranksep 80

title Reiseplanleggeren - Heksagonal Arkitektur

package "app\n(Presentasjonslag)" #LightBlue {
    [Web Application] as App
}

package "core\n(Domenelogikk)" #LightGreen {
    together {
        [RouteSearch] as RouteSearch
        [UserService] as UserService
    }
}

package "PORTS\n(Grensesnitt)" #LightYellow {
    together {
        [EnturPort] as EnturPort
        [CalendarPort] as CalendarPort
        [UserPort] as UserPort
    }
}

package "ADAPTERS\n(Implementasjoner)" #LightCoral {
    together {
        [EnturAdapter] as EnturAdapter
        [GoogleCalendar\nAdapter] as CalendarAdapter
        [DatabaseUser\nAdapter] as DatabaseAdapter
    }
}

cloud "Eksterne Systemer" {
    together {
        [Entur API] as EnturAPI
        [Google Calendar] as GoogleCal
        database "MySQL Database" as MySQL
    }
}

App -[hidden]down-> RouteSearch
RouteSearch -[hidden]down-> EnturPort
EnturPort -[hidden]down-> EnturAdapter
EnturAdapter -[hidden]down-> EnturAPI

UserService -[hidden]down-> UserPort
CalendarPort -[hidden]down-> CalendarAdapter
CalendarAdapter -[hidden]down-> GoogleCal

' App til Core
App --> RouteSearch : bruker
App --> UserService : bruker

' Core til Ports
RouteSearch ..> EnturPort : avhenger av
RouteSearch ..> CalendarPort : avhenger av
UserService ..> UserPort : avhenger av

' Adapters implementerer Ports
EnturAdapter .up.|> EnturPort : implementerer
CalendarAdapter .up.|> CalendarPort : implementerer
DatabaseAdapter .up.|> UserPort : implementerer

' Adapters til eksterne systemer
EnturAdapter --> EnturAPI : Leser data fra
CalendarAdapter --> GoogleCal : Leser data fra
DatabaseAdapter --> MySQL : Leser/skriver til


note right of DatabaseAdapter
    **NB: DatabaseUserAdapter**

    Ikke en fullstendig heksagonal
    arkitektur-implementasjon, men
    organisert slik for å illustrere
    konseptet.

    De heksagonale prinsippene er
    korrekt implementert i:
    • EnturAdapter
    • GoogleCalendarAdapter
end note

@enduml
